# The build context for web.Dockerfile. Deny first, then name the storefront's
# sources: the web package and the control-plane modules it imports.
*
!control-plane
control-plane/**/node_modules
control-plane/web/.next
control-plane/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
control-plane/**/*.test.ts
control-plane/**/*.test.tsx
control-plane/web/e2e
